    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>MORE GAMES</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487060/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1709548117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487060/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1709548117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487060/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1709548117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487060/extras/b0877183fdbb001dd35858b9257f5e9c.webp?t=1709548117\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In Locksmith Simulator you get to become the handy-man everyone turns to with their epic day-to-day challenges. Find a way to open various casing, chests, safes and complex car locks.</h2><br><br>Use your wits and find the best tool for each job. Use your gear to solve seemingly tough situations. These will include trapped pets, locked treasures, massive gates that need repair and busted security locks that you\u2019ll need opened or fixed to help out your clients.<br><br><br><br>Expand your workshop by buying additional equipment and gear which will allow you to perform more heroic deeds such as fixing broken tools, assembling a safe, producing fool-proof locks and keys, installing gates and doors and fitting new locks where they belong. <br><br><br><br>Unlock Steam Achievements and become the best Locksmith in town!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487060/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.poster.avif?t=1709548117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487060/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.webm?t=1709548117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487060/extras/dd9124abe6bf6bd35dcf2aaae8e252b0.mp4?t=1709548117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1487060/extras/b0877183fdbb001dd35858b9257f5e9c.webp?t=1709548117\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">In Locksmith Simulator you get to become the handy-man everyone turns to with their epic day-to-day challenges. Find a way to open various casing, chests, safes and complex car locks.</h2><br><br>Use your wits and find the best tool for each job. Use your gear to solve seemingly tough situations. These will include trapped pets, locked treasures, massive gates that need repair and busted security locks that you\u2019ll need opened or fixed to help out your clients.<br><br><br><br>Expand your workshop by buying additional equipment and gear which will allow you to perform more heroic deeds such as fixing broken tools, assembling a safe, producing fool-proof locks and keys, installing gates and doors and fitting new locks where they belong. <br><br><br><br>Unlock Steam Achievements and become the best Locksmith in town!",
    "short_description": "Become a local hero! Fix doors, open locks and help damsels in distress.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
